			"notes": "## Field Emitters 1.1.0\n\n- Hollow domes and spherical fields, plus surface-rail bridges aligned with adjacent blocks.\n- Independent directional rules and allow/block lists for players, mobs and items. Drag items and spawn eggs from compatible recipe browsers into filters.\n- Access badges and groups, private networks, invited managers and optional public management. Passage access is separate from management permissions.\n- Inventory checkpoints can detect contraband, deny passage, drop matching items on the entry side or transfer them into adjacent storage.\n- Adjustable contact damage, directional damage filters and fizzle effects.\n- New textures, color presets, six formation animations and configurable sounds. Plasma dissolve works with every texture. Simultaneous impact ripples brighten where they intersect on walls and bridges.\n- Reorganized tuner controls, immediate updates and improved scaling. Optional wearable support where available.\n- ZeroMods Core is bundled. No separate Core download is needed.\n\nInstall the matching build on both client and server. Fabric requires Fabric API and Forge Config API Port.\n\nKnown compatibility issue: Sable 2.0.5 on Fabric 1.21.1 can render parts of assembled structures invisibly. This also reproduced with Field Emitters removed; field collision and filtering were tested separately.\n\n## Downloads\n\nChoose the jar matching your Minecraft version and loader. Install it on both client and server. **ZeroMods Core is included inside every jar.** Fabric API and Forge Config API Port remain separate requirements for Fabric.\n\n| Minecraft | Loader | Source |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1.21.1 | NeoForge | [4f9c128](https://github.com/shikyo13/Field-Emitters/tree/4f9c12874632781666ef49e07dbfeef7f4ed9de6) |\n| 1.21.1 | Forge | [dcd07d9](https://github.com/shikyo13/Field-Emitters/tree/dcd07d91667bf5950c89293a663b837fea32e8b3) |\n| 1.20.1 | Forge | [f60642a](https://github.com/shikyo13/Field-Emitters/tree/f60642a96b375d296dde7d73dd10baead2705241) |\n| 1.21.1 | Fabric | [6f73e03](https://github.com/shikyo13/Field-Emitters/tree/6f73e032ba6665ed0f4ef59a3303c25f5d694420) |\n| 1.20.1 | Fabric | [825557d](https://github.com/shikyo13/Field-Emitters/tree/825557dd8ac70cb307c22cdae1ce7e489e994bf3) |\n\nBundled Core source: [6cb9897](https://github.com/shikyo13/ZeroMods-Core/tree/6cb9897d13cd7a5041efb2616bb1dab2d7ffbea8). Asset checksums are in SHA256SUMS.txt.\n\nIncludes the Forge 1.20.1 field-culling fix from [PR #3](https://github.com/shikyo13/Field-Emitters/pull/3) and the Sable field collision/hex-pattern fix for [issue #1](https://github.com/shikyo13/Field-Emitters/issues/1)."
